{"seq":2,"slug":"rewrite-suggestion-trigger","title":"改写建议触发条件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/related-search-query-recommendation/did-you-mean-rewrite/rewrite-suggestion-trigger","wordCount":2554,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"改写建议触发条件\">改写建议触发条件</h1><p>上一篇确立了「建议优于替换」的姿态，并且把纠错门控按置信度分了四档。那个框架有一个隐含假设：<strong>只要置信度够，就值得显示建议</strong>。这个假设在多数情况下成立，但不是全部——因为显示建议本身有成本，而这个成本与置信度无关。用户的查询 <code>case</code>（英语里既可以指手机壳，也可以指箱子）置信度中等，任何纠错建议都可能是错的；而一个已经连搜三次、每次都在改词的用户，再给他一行「你是不是想找」只会增加噪音。这一篇讨论触发条件：什么时候值得占用一行版面，什么时候最好什么都不说。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-触发是一个收益计算-不是一个阈值\">核心概念：触发是一个收益计算，不是一个阈值</h2><p>把触发决策写成期望收益，判断标准会清晰得多：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>trigger</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>correct</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>U</mi><mtext>correct</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>correct</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>wrong</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>show</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[\\text{trigger}] = P(\\text{correct}) \\cdot \\Delta U_{\\text{correct}} - (1 - P(\\text{correct})) \\cdot C_{\\text{wrong}} - C_{\\text{show}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">trigger</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">correct</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">correct</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">correct</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">wrong</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">show</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>三项分别是：纠错正确时用户节省的成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span>、纠错错误时用户被误导的成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>wrong</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{wrong}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">wrong</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、以及<strong>无论对错都要付的展示成本</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>show</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{show}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">show</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>前两项在上一篇讨论过了。这一篇的核心是第三项：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>show</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{show}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">show</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是什么，为什么它不能忽略。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>show</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{show}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">show</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的构成有三块。<strong>版面成本</strong>：一行建议占据屏幕上的一块区域，在移动端尤其昂贵，它挤掉的是可见结果数。<strong>注意力成本</strong>：用户扫结果列表时，这一行会打断他的扫视节奏，即使他不点击也需要处理它的存在。<strong>信任成本</strong>：每多显示一次无效建议，用户对这块版面的信任就下降一点，最终形成「这些提示都是废话」的心智，届时连正确的建议也会被忽略。</p>\n<p>第三块是最重要的，因为它<strong>不可逆且有累积效应</strong>。前两块是当次的成本，第三块是跨次累积的——一次错误的建议会降低未来所有建议的效果。这就是为什么触发条件必须比直觉更保守。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>「误报会累积地侵蚀用户信任」这一条在自动预测功能上有公开的行业证据与处理方式。Google 对搜索预测披露：自动系统会先拦截暴力、色情、仇恨、骚扰、危险、粗俗、与恐怖主义相关的预测；自动系统漏掉时由人工团队移除「该预测及密切相关的变体」；并针对选举、医学上危险、以及对具名个人的贬损关联等类别单独加严，见 <a href=\"https://support.google.com/websearch/answer/7368877\">Google Search 关于自动预测的说明</a>。这里值得注意的是**「密切相关的变体」也要一起移除**——因为用户对「这一类词会被系统放出来」的印象一旦形成，只移除一条并不能恢复信任。</th>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>置信度</th>\n<th>建议显示</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>拼写错误 + 高频目标词</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>是（可静默）</td>\n<td>收益明确，成本可忽略</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拼写错误 + 长尾目标词</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>是（纯建议）</td>\n<td>收益中等，风险低</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无结果 + 任何置信度</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>展示成本被空页面的损失覆盖</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结果充足 + 查询合法</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>收益不明确，只付成本</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户正在快速连续改词</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>用户已有明确策略，打扰是负收益</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>敏感话题（医疗/金融）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>否或极保守</td>\n<td>错误成本远超收益</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"三类不触发的情况\">三类不触发的情况</h2><h3 id=\"用户已经在主动收敛\">用户已经在主动收敛</h3><p>一个被普遍忽略的触发抑制信号：<strong>用户当前的行为已经表明他知道自己在做什么</strong>。具体表现为三种模式。连续多次搜索且每次都在收窄（<code>耳机</code> → <code>耳机 anc</code> → <code>耳机 anc 索尼</code>）说明用户有清晰的检索策略，此时系统最有价值的动作是<strong>不要干扰</strong>。刚刚点击过结果的用户正在消费内容，此时插入一行建议是打断。已经回退过多次（说明他在尝试不同方向）的用户，需要的不是纠错而是别的方向。</p>\n<p>这个抑制规则的实现不需要复杂模型：会话内查询次数、点击次数、以及查询之间的编辑距离变化方向，三个指标就能判定。它的收益在真实系统里通常比新增一个纠错信号更大，因为它减少的是<strong>已经在付的展示成本</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"查询本身是合法的低频词\">查询本身是合法的低频词</h3><p>上一篇已经提过绝对频次下限。这里补充另一面：<strong>有些查询不需要纠错，因为它们根本不该被纠错</strong>。型号、SKU、品牌缩写、外语词、以及站内已有的实体名，都属于这一类。它们的共同特征是「看起来像错别字但其实是专有名词」。</p>\n<p>维护一个<strong>白名单</strong>是必要的，但白名单有维护成本。更可持续的做法是<strong>用行为数据自动判定</strong>：如果一个查询有稳定的点击行为（有相当比例的曝光产生了点击，且点击的商品集中在某个类目），那么它就是一个合法查询，无论它看起来多像错别字。反之，一个查询零点击率高、且编辑距离 1 处存在高频词，才是纠错的候选。这条判据把「合法性」定义在行为上而不是词表上，自动覆盖了新品与新品牌。</p>\n<h3 id=\"敏感与高风险查询\">敏感与高风险查询</h3><p>医疗、金融、法律相关的查询需要<strong>额外的保守系数</strong>。理由不是这些话题特殊，而是<strong>这两类错误的成本不对称被放大了</strong>。用户搜 <code>is it safe to take x with y</code>（药物相互作用），一次错误的纠错可能把 <code>x</code> 改成另一个药名，后果远超一次糟糕的购物体验。金融查询里 <code>rate</code> 与 <code>rate cut</code> 的差异同样如此。</p>\n<p>处理方式不是禁用，而是<strong>提高门控阈值并强制走纯建议路径</strong>：低置信度一律不触发，高置信度也只给建议、不静默替换。同时这类查询的纠错结果应当进入人工抽检队列，而不是完全依赖自动门控。识别这类查询可以用类目预测或关键词表，两种方法都不需要高精度——<strong>宁可多判一些，因为这里的误判代价是保守而非冒进</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"触发时机的层次\">触发时机的层次</h2><p>触发不是一个二元决定，而是四个层次，每一层的成本不同。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[查询到达] --&gt; B[纠错器产出候选 + 置信度]&#10;    B --&gt; C{命中抑制条件?&lt;br/&gt;用户主动收敛/白名单/敏感}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[不触发&lt;br/&gt;记 suppress_reason]&#10;    C --&gt;|否| E{结果集是否为空?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[L3: 强制触发&lt;br/&gt;纯建议, 阈值降至 0.4]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G{置信度档位}&#10;    G --&gt;|&gt;=0.95| H[L0: 静默替换&lt;br/&gt;不占版面]&#10;    G --&gt;|&gt;=0.70| I[L1: 结果按纠错词检索&lt;br/&gt;顶部替换提示]&#10;    G --&gt;|&gt;=0.45| J[L2: 纯建议行&lt;br/&gt;结果不变]&#10;    G --&gt;|&lt;0.45| K[不触发纠错&lt;br/&gt;交给相关搜索引导]&#10;    F --&gt; L[埋点: level/confidence/suppress]&#10;    H --&gt; L&#10;    I --&gt; L&#10;    J --&gt; L&#10;    K --&gt; L\">flowchart TD\n    A[查询到达] --&gt; B[纠错器产出候选 + 置信度]\n    B --&gt; C{命中抑制条件?&lt;br/&gt;用户主动收敛/白名单/敏感}\n    C --&gt;|是| D[不触发&lt;br/&gt;记 suppress_reason]\n    C --&gt;|否| E{结果集是否为空?}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[L3: 强制触发&lt;br/&gt;纯建议, 阈值降至 0.4]\n    E --&gt;|否| G{置信度档位}\n    G --&gt;|&gt;=0.95| H[L0: 静默替换&lt;br/&gt;不占版面]\n    G --&gt;|&gt;=0.70| I[L1: 结果按纠错词检索&lt;br/&gt;顶部替换提示]\n    G --&gt;|&gt;=0.45| J[L2: 纯建议行&lt;br/&gt;结果不变]\n    G --&gt;|&lt;0.45| K[不触发纠错&lt;br/&gt;交给相关搜索引导]\n    F --&gt; L[埋点: level/confidence/suppress]\n    H --&gt; L\n    I --&gt; L\n    J --&gt; L\n    K --&gt; L</pre><p>层次设计的要点是<strong>成本越低的层次，适用条件可以越宽松</strong>。L0（静默替换）不占任何版面，因此它唯一的约束是正确率；L2（纯建议行）要占一行，因此除了正确率还要过抑制条件；L3（无结果强制触发）在空页面上展示，成本被原有的损失覆盖，因此条件最宽。把「成本」显式建模进层次，比用一套统一阈值处理所有场景更接近实际。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多候选与排序\">多候选与排序</h2><p>纠错器常常给出两个以上候选（<code>iphyone</code> 可以纠成 <code>iphone</code> 或 <code>ipad</code>）。展示多候选的决策需要额外纪律。</p>\n<p><strong>默认只展示一个。</strong> 多候选意味着纠错器自己不确定，把不确定性转嫁给用户会让这一行变长、注意力成本上升。只有在两个候选<strong>语义上确实分属不同意图</strong>且置信度接近时（差距小于某个小量），才值得展示两个。</p>\n<p><strong>候选之间要去重与去包含。</strong> <code>iphone case</code> 与 <code>iphone 15 case</code> 同时出现是冗余的，因为后者是前者的细化。这里可以复用第一章的边结构判定方向关系，见 <a href=\"../related-query-candidates/session-cooccur-graph\">会话共现与 query 图</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>与相关搜索列表的竞争。</strong> 如果纠错候选同时也在相关搜索列表里出现，应当把它从相关搜索列表里移走而不是两处都显示。展示预算是一块整版面，组件之间必须共享约束，这一点在第四章第 1 篇里有完整的讨论。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;trigger_eval&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;query&quot;: &quot;iphyone 15 case&quot;,&#10;    &quot;level&quot;: &quot;L2&quot;,&#10;    &quot;suppressed&quot;: false,&#10;    &quot;suppress_checks&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;user_converging&quot;: false,&#10;      &quot;whitelist_hit&quot;: false,&#10;      &quot;sensitive_topic&quot;: false,&#10;      &quot;zero_result&quot;: false&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;candidates&quot;: [&#10;      { &quot;q&quot;: &quot;iphone 15 case&quot;, &quot;p&quot;: 0.91, &quot;show&quot;: true },&#10;      { &quot;q&quot;: &quot;iphone 15 cover&quot;, &quot;p&quot;: 0.48, &quot;show&quot;: false, &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;redundant_with_top1&quot; }&#10;    ],&#10;    &quot;budget&quot;: { &quot;lines_used&quot;: 1, &quot;lines_max&quot;: 2 }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"trigger_eval\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"query\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"iphyone 15 case\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"L2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"suppressed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"suppress_checks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"user_converging\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"whitelist_hit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"sensitive_topic\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"zero_result\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"candidates\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"q\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"iphone 15 case\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"p\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.91</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"show\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"q\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"iphone 15 cover\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"p\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.48</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"show\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"redundant_with_top1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"budget\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"lines_used\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"lines_max\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>lines_max</code> 的存在提醒实现者：<strong>建议行有全局预算</strong>，不是每个组件都可以独立决定要不要占一行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"触发后的可回滚性\">触发后的可回滚性</h2><p>最后一个工程约束容易被忽略：<strong>触发决策必须可回滚，而且回滚应当是配置变更而不是代码发布</strong>。因为触发阈值是需要持续校准的参数，而校准的依据来自线上行为。如果调一次阈值要走一次发布，实际结果是阈值设错了也没人调。</p>\n<p>可回滚意味着三件事：阈值从配置中心读、每个层次可以独立开关、以及<strong>关掉某个层次之后系统仍然正常工作</strong>（L1 关掉时降级为 L2，L2 关掉时降级为不触发）。把降级路径设计清楚，就不必担心一次误配置导致线上事故。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[配置中心: gate_thresholds] --&gt; B[纠错服务]&#10;    C[配置中心: level_switches] --&gt; B&#10;    B --&gt; D{L0 开启?}&#10;    D --&gt;|否| E{L1 开启?}&#10;    E --&gt;|否| F{L2 开启?}&#10;    F --&gt;|否| G[输出: 不触发纠错]\">graph LR\n    A[配置中心: gate_thresholds] --&gt; B[纠错服务]\n    C[配置中心: level_switches] --&gt; B\n    B --&gt; D{L0 开启?}\n    D --&gt;|否| E{L1 开启?}\n    E --&gt;|否| F{L2 开启?}\n    F --&gt;|否| G[输出: 不触发纠错]</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>触发是<strong>期望收益计算</strong>而非阈值判断：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>U</mi><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = P \\cdot \\Delta U - (1-P)\\cdot C_{wrong} - C_{show}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{show}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 常被忽略但包含不可逆的<strong>信任成本</strong>。</li>\n<li>三类不触发情况：用户已在主动收敛（它减少的是已经在付的展示成本）、查询是合法的低频/专有词（用行为数据而非词表判定）、敏感高风险话题（提高阈值 + 强制纯建议 + 人工抽检）。</li>\n<li>四个层次（静默替换 / 替换检索 / 纯建议 / 无结果强制）的成本不同，<strong>成本越低条件可越宽松</strong>。</li>\n<li>多候选默认只展示一个；候选之间去冗余可复用第一章的方向判定；与相关搜索列表共享版面预算。</li>\n<li>触发决策必须可配置、可独立开关、有明确降级路径，否则阈值永远不会被校准。</li>\n<li>抑制条件的埋点（<code>suppress_reason</code>）与层次埋点同等重要——知道「为什么没触发」是调优的另一半。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"改写建议触发条件","id":"改写建议触发条件"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：触发是一个收益计算，不是一个阈值","id":"核心概念-触发是一个收益计算-不是一个阈值"},{"level":2,"text":"三类不触发的情况","id":"三类不触发的情况"},{"level":3,"text":"用户已经在主动收敛","id":"用户已经在主动收敛"},{"level":3,"text":"查询本身是合法的低频词","id":"查询本身是合法的低频词"},{"level":3,"text":"敏感与高风险查询","id":"敏感与高风险查询"},{"level":2,"text":"触发时机的层次","id":"触发时机的层次"},{"level":2,"text":"多候选与排序","id":"多候选与排序"},{"level":2,"text":"触发后的可回滚性","id":"触发后的可回滚性"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"低置信纠错的建议而非替换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/related-search-query-recommendation/did-you-mean-rewrite/low-confidence-correction-ui"},"next":{"title":"引导词风控与质量护栏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/related-search-query-recommendation/did-you-mean-rewrite/suggestion-abuse-guard"}}